sequenceDiagram

participant Web
participant Socket
participant SubscriptionStore
participant EventBridge
participant RT as Realtime Middleware

Web->>Socket: connect()

Web->>Socket: subscribe(PATIENT#PAT101)

Socket->>SubscriptionStore: Store subscription

EventBridge->>RT: VitalUpdated.v1

RT->>SubscriptionStore: Find subscribers for PATIENT#PAT101

SubscriptionStore-->>RT: DoctorA

RT->>Socket: Push update

Socket->>Web: VITAL_UPDATED

Web->>Web: invalidateQueries()